            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ElinM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this recipe since it didn't call for eggs and I was out. I made several other change though too - greek yogurt instead of sour cream, milk instead of half &amp; half, and almond extract instead of vanilla. I also added a cup of fresh mulberries. They are super moist and have a great flavor. I'll make them again for sure!",
